      "notes": "balanced v2 已有用户人工反馈：变化不激进、曲线 connector 更像带过去，但仍不作为全局默认。"
    },
    {
      "id": "C",
      "name": "execution_width_pressure_comparison",
      "baseline": "fixed width / flat pressure execution",
